    <string name="s_delete_account_explanation">Your account, your password, your profile picture and your birthday are deleted, and every device you are signed in on is signed out. Your direct chats go too, for the other person as well. What stays is what the family said to each other: your messages in the family chat, your board notes and your reactions, shown from then on as \"Deleted account\". This cannot be undone.</string>
